Acquisition vocabulary subset derived from the HUPO Proteomics Standards Initiative
PSI-MS controlled vocabulary, version 4.1.261.
Source: https://github.com/HUPO-PSI/psi-ms-CV
Upstream licence: https://github.com/HUPO-PSI/psi-ms-CV/blob/master/Licence.txt
