Modified for mzmine: selected instrument, analyzer, ionization, detector and acquisition
method categories; retained only accessions and canonical labels, omitting definitions.
The accompanying TSV records the original source SHA-256 and version. No endorsement
by the vocabulary authors is implied.

Reference: Mayer et al. (2013), The HUPO proteomics standards initiative - mass
spectrometry controlled vocabulary. Database, bat009.
https://doi.org/10.1093/database/bat009
